9310BD        GO TO 230-CONTINUE.
9310BD     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
9310BD        MOVE "DBFIND DVENDOR 160 SQUOTUPD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
9310BD        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
9310BD
9310BD 220-DVENDOR-LOOP.
