044200************************************************************
044300*   COMPUTE WHAT PRICE SHOULD BE FOR THE ORDERED QTY       *
044400************************************************************
044500 830-FIND-PRICE.
044600     MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE         TO FOUND-PRICE.
           IF VEN-DSCT IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE ZEROES TO VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT.
044700     IF VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT = ZEROES
044800        NEXT SENTENCE
044900     ELSE
045000         COMPUTE FOUND-PRICE ROUNDED =
045100             VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT / 100
045200         COMPUTE FOUND-PRICE ROUNDED = VEN-ITM-PRICE -
045300             (VEN-ITM-PRICE * FOUND-PRICE).
045400
045500     IF VEN-LOW-QTY (1) = ZERO
045600        GO TO 835-LAST-CHANCE.
045700     IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT < VEN-LOW-QTY (1)
045800        IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT > VEN-HIGH-QTY (1)
046000           MOVE VEN-WORK-PRICE (1) TO FOUND-PRICE.
046100     IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT < VEN-LOW-QTY (2)
046200        IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT > VEN-HIGH-QTY (2)
046400           MOVE VEN-WORK-PRICE (2) TO FOUND-PRICE.
046500     IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT < VEN-LOW-QTY (3)
046600        IF VEN-BID-QTY NOT > VEN-HIGH-QTY (3)
046800           MOVE VEN-WORK-PRICE (3) TO FOUND-PRICE.
046900
047000  835-LAST-CHANCE.
047111     IF FOUND-PRICE = ZERO
047112        MOVE VEN-ITM-PRICE    TO FOUND-PRICE.
047113
