047115 840-SET-JCW.
047120*----------  SETJCW 'JCWQT' TO 0 TO TELL XLOADPO.OBJECT THAT THIS
047130*            ABSTFILE WAS CREATED FROM A QUOTE PROGRAM.  IF THIS
047140*            PROGRAM ENDS WITHOUT ABORTING, 'JCWQT' WILL BE CHANGED
047150*            TO A 1.
047160*    MOVE "SETJCW JCWQT = 0" TO COMMAND.
100800     MOVE "0"      TO SETJCW-VALUE.
           MOVE 290      TO SETJCW-STARTING-POS.
           MOVE 1        TO SETJCW-LENGTH.
           CALL "SETJCW" USING SETJCW-VALUE,
                               SETJCW-STARTING-POS,
                               SETJCW-LENGTH,
                               SETJCW-STATUS.
           IF SETJCW-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "SETJCW ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE SETJCW-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
047230         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
047240
